# Explicit type registrations for this directory.
#
# `import "widget"` on an implicit directory is registered lazily by
# Quickshell's QML scanner, and the first type looked up in a
# not-yet-registered copy fails with "<T> is not a type" - a different
# type each run, and the widget renders as nothing. Observed as
# `TickRing is not a type` in the dev harness. See PORTING.md item 21.
# Adding a file here means adding its line below; tests/run.sh enforces it.
AlbumArt 1.0 AlbumArt.qml
AudioSpectrum 1.0 AudioSpectrum.qml
BarLayout 1.0 BarLayout.qml
ControlButton 1.0 ControlButton.qml
FlipAlbumArt 1.0 FlipAlbumArt.qml
MarqueeText 1.0 MarqueeText.qml
MusicSlider 1.0 MusicSlider.qml
SquareLayout 1.0 SquareLayout.qml
TallWideLayout 1.0 TallWideLayout.qml
WideLayout 1.0 WideLayout.qml
